From 1a2ad7b256a0af69dd5d49737f5c8a51865b0d22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 20 Aug 2026 21:16:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Stripe subscription billing (checkout, customer portal,
 webhook sync)

- schema: SubscriptionStatus enum + stripe fields on User
- server/stripe.js: checkout/portal session creation, webhook handler
  that syncs subscription state onto the User row
- server.js: mount /webhooks/stripe (raw body), /api/billing/{checkout,
  portal,status}, stripeEnabled in /api/config
- web: Billing tab (upgrade / manage billing), api.js billing calls
- package.json: add stripe SDK
- .env.example: document STRIPE_SECRET_KEY, STRIPE_PRICE_ID,
  STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET

Needs the Pro product/price created in the Stripe dashboard and the
three env vars set on Railway before this does anything live.
